<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title><?= html_escape($header['no_surat']) ?></title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:18mm}body{font:14px 'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.5;color:#111}.paper{max-width:800px;margin:auto}.center{text-align:center}.right{text-align:right}.kop{border-bottom:3px double #111;padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:20px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0}th,td{border:1px solid #444;padding:6px}.signature{width:45%;margin-left:auto;text-align:center;margin-top:35px}.btn{padding:9px 14px;background:#1266f1;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:4px}@media print{.no-print{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class="paper"><div class="kop center"><h2 style="margin:0"><?= html_escape(config_item('nama_sekolah')?:'SEKOLAH') ?></h2><div>Surat Pemberitahuan Tunggakan</div></div><div class="right"><?= html_escape($header['tanggal_surat']) ?></div><p>Nomor: <strong><?= html_escape($header['no_surat']) ?></strong></p><p>Yth. Bapak/Ibu Orang Tua/Wali<br><strong><?= html_escape($header['nama_siswa']) ?></strong><br>Kelas <?= html_escape($header['nama_kelas']) ?></p><p>Dengan hormat, berdasarkan catatan administrasi sekolah, terdapat tagihan wajib yang belum diselesaikan sebagai berikut:</p><table><thead><tr><th>No</th><th>Tagihan</th><th>Periode</th><th class="right">Nominal</th><th class="right">Dibayar</th><th class="right">Sisa</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($detail as $i=>$d): ?><tr><td><?= $i+1 ?></td><td><?= html_escape($d['nama_tagihan']) ?></td><td><?= html_escape(($d['nama_bulan']?:'').' '.$d['tahun']) ?></td><td class="right"><?= rupiah($d['nominal_tagihan']) ?></td><td class="right"><?= rupiah($d['nominal_dibayar']) ?></td><td class="right"><?= rupiah($d['sisa_tagihan']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach ?><tr><th colspan="5" class="right">Total Tunggakan</th><th class="right"><?= rupiah($header['total_tunggakan']) ?></th></tr></tbody></table><?php if($header['catatan_surat']): ?><p><?= nl2br(html_escape($header['catatan_surat'])) ?></p><?php endif ?><p>Demikian pemberitahuan ini kami sampaikan. Atas perhatian dan kerja sama Bapak/Ibu, kami mengucapkan terima kasih.</p><div class="signature"><div><?= html_escape($header['jabatan_penandatangan']) ?></div><div style="height:70px"></div><strong><u><?= html_escape($header['nama_penandatangan']) ?></u></strong></div><div class="center no-print" style="margin-top:30px"><button class="btn" onclick="window.print()">Cetak / Simpan PDF</button></div></div></body></html>
